    "# Notebook 05 — Musicological Validation & Quantitative XAI Metrics\n",
    "### XAI for Music Genre Classification | GTZAN Dataset\n",
    "---\n",
    "**Purpose:** This is the core research contribution notebook.\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Musicological alignment score** — Do SHAP/LIME highlight musicologically meaningful frequency bands?\n",
    "2. **Faithfulness metric** — Remove top-K SHAP regions, measure accuracy drop\n",
    "3. **Inter-method agreement** — Do SHAP and LIME agree on what matters?\n",
    "4. **Spurious correlation detection** — Does the model attend to recording artifacts?\n",
    "\n",
    "These are the quantitative tables and figures that go into the paper."
   ]
  },
